      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1730874913949,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "functional requirements\n- users can run patent infringement check against specific company, and patent id \n- users can get top two infringement products with name, explanation, relevant claims, specific features,\n  and an overall risk assessment.\n- users can save reports and revisit saved reports. \nnonfunctional requirements\n- deduplicate returned products\n- support large amount of products by companies\n- support fuzzy search by company name\n---not support in current state ---\n- rate limiter request\n- cache request\n- vector db backup and fault tolerance",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "functional requirements\n- users can run patent infringement check against specific company, and patent id \n- users can get top two infringement products with name, explanation, relevant claims, specific features,\n  and an overall risk assessment.\n- users can save reports and revisit saved reports. \nnonfunctional requirements\n- deduplicate returned products\n- support large amount of products by companies\n- support fuzzy search by company name\n---not support in current state ---\n- rate limiter request\n- cache request\n- vector db backup and fault tolerance",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
